# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  This site runs on nginx (BT / aaPanel). Apache .htaccess files are
#  IGNORED by nginx - nothing in this file has any effect.
#
#  The real rules live in the nginx vhost:
#      /www/server/panel/vhost/nginx/makemyqrcode.com.conf
#
#  A ready-to-paste copy of the SEO / caching rules is kept in:
#      deploy/nginx-makemyqrcode.conf
#
#  Already handled by the vhost (do not duplicate here):
#      - http  -> https          301
#      - www   -> non-www        301
#      - gzip compression
#      - custom 404 / 502 pages
#      - directory listing 403
#      - HSTS, X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy
#      - css/js/image cache lifetimes
#
#  Still to be added to the vhost (see deploy/nginx-makemyqrcode.conf):
#      - /index.html      -> /                      301
#      - /foo.html/       -> /foo.html              301
#      - Cache-Control on HTML responses
#      - Permissions-Policy header
#      - X-Robots-Tag noindex on /counter.php
#      - immutable caching for .webp / .woff2
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
